---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and information"
  description="The scope of Dr. Jee Hoon Ju’s personal website and its clinic booking information."
  light
>
  <div class="wrap page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Information & scope</p>
    <h1>Using this site.</h1>
  </div>
  <article class="wrap reading">
    <h2>General information</h2>
    <p>
      This is Dr. Jee Hoon Ju’s personal website. Its content helps you prepare
      questions and understand the scope of clinical care and his work as a
      founder. It does not provide an individual diagnosis or treatment
      recommendation.
    </p>
    <h2>Appointments and care</h2>
    <p>
      Clinical requests are managed by Tune Clinic. Submitting a request is not
      a confirmed appointment, a purchase, or a guarantee of consultation with
      Dr. Ju. The clinic confirms availability, treating physician, treatment
      suitability, scope and price. Use the clinic’s confirmation and management
      messages to change an existing request.
    </p>
    <h2>Experience and evidence</h2>
    <p>
      Creator collaborations and personal experiences may include promotional
      arrangements. Individual experiences do not establish treatment
      effectiveness or predict another person’s result. Ask the treating
      physician about evidence, risks, alternatives and follow-up.
    </p>
    <h2>Urgent concerns</h2>
    <p>
      Website forms and business inquiries are not emergency services. For
      urgent medical concerns, seek local medical care rather than waiting for
      an online response.
    </p>
    <h2>Information updates</h2>
    <p>
      Clinic availability, prices and services may change. Linked clinic
      information and your individual quote should be confirmed before making
      treatment or travel decisions. For corrections to this website, contact{" "}
      <a href="mailto:drjeeju@aetherheal.com">drjeeju@aetherheal.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
